1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:06,650
Wire a transformer test, switch on, and watch the meters respond. All in 3D.

2
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:11,900
But in a real lab, high voltage means you rarely do the wiring.

3
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:16,020
You learn from a diagram, and one wrong connection can damage equipment.

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,020
Learn mode explains every step.

5
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:21,320
Self mode checks your wiring and shows what went wrong.

6
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:24,550
Take readings, plot curves, check your answers.

7
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,980
Virtual Machines Lab. Practise before you power on.
